<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Organizations</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main id="main-content" role="main">
        <h1>
            <%= title %>
        </h1>
    
        <!-- Intro -->
        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Our Partner Organizations</h2>
            <p>
                We collaborate with a variety of organizations that lead projects in
                environmental sustainability, education, community service, and health.
                These partnerships make it possible to connect volunteers with meaningful
                opportunities and resources.
            </p>
        </section>
    
        <!-- Organization list -->
        <section class="org-list">
            <div class="org-list">
                <article>
                    <h3>Green Earth Initiative</h3>
                    <p>
                        Dedicated to environmental conservation, recycling programs, and
                        sustainability education. Volunteers help with tree planting, clean‑up
                        campaigns, and awareness workshops.
                    </p>
                </article>
        
                <article>
                    <h3>Bright Minds Academy</h3>
                    <p>
                        Focused on educational support, tutoring, and resource development for
                        students of all ages. Projects include after‑school programs and
                        literacy campaigns.
                    </p>
                </article>
        
                <article>
                    <h3>Community Builders Network</h3>
                    <p>
                        A coalition of local groups working to strengthen neighborhoods through
                        service projects, food drives, and housing support initiatives.
                    </p>
                </article>
        
                <article>
                    <h3>Wellness for All Foundation</h3>
                    <p>
                        Promotes health and wellness through fitness workshops, mental health
                        awareness events, and community clinics. Volunteers assist with outreach
                        and event coordination.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    
        <!-- Call to action -->
        <section class="cta">
            <h2>Join an Organization</h2>
            <p>
                Interested in partnering or volunteering? Explore the categories to find
                organizations that align with your passions. Each group offers unique
                opportunities to serve and grow.
            </p>
            <a href="/projects" class="button">View Current Projects</a>
        </section>
    </main>
      
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>